validator_discipline:
- receipt validators require explicit adapter-specific required fields
- missing bank_api_called is rejected
- missing supplier_api_called is rejected
- missing inventory_reserved is rejected
- absent false flags are not treated as safe false
- ExecutionEvidence validator requires full shape
- source_root_outcome_id mismatch is rejected
- connector_sandbox_completed false is rejected
- expired packet is rejected before adapters
- non-Root-created packet is rejected before adapters
- unknown adapter is rejected
- duplicate receipt is rejected
- missing receipt is rejected
- receipt claiming real action is rejected
- no network/secrets static checks passed

limitation:
- expiry uses deterministic scenario time in v0.1
- scenario_time: 2026-06-22T12:00:00+00:00
- packet_expires_at: 2026-06-22T13:00:00+00:00
- later production work must replace this with signed TTL / wall-clock policy
- still not real payment, not real shipment, not production

